@@ -0,0 +1,5 @@
+ -  Fixed successful parses with many positional arguments to take time close
+    to linear in the number of arguments instead of quadratic time.  Every
+    recorded input copied the entire input trace, so a parse of a few thousand
+    positional arguments spent most of its time copying; a parse of 8,000
+    positional arguments is now about eight times faster.
